      <article  about="/departments-and-services/community-development/building/adopted-codes-and-regulations-building" class="node">

  
<div  class="page-header">
  
  <h1  class="page-header__title h1">
          <span>Adopted Codes and Regulations for the Building Department</span>

      </h1>
  </div>

  <div  class="basic-page">
    
    

      <div class="field-content">
                
  <h2  class="rich-text__h2 h2">
          

            <div class="field-heading">Adopted codes</div>
      
      </h2>

  

<div  class="rich-text">
  <div  class="flexgrid-nm">
    <div  class="rich-text__body">
              

            <div class="text-long"><h3 class="h3">The 2026 NEC and 2024 Colorado Plumbing and Fuel Gas Code will be effective January 1,2027.</h3>
<p><strong>In compliance with HB21-1110 Mesa County Ordinance adopting and amending Building Codes&nbsp; are unable to be posted on this site.</strong></p>
<p><strong>For assistance contact us at </strong><a href="tel:9702441631"><strong>970-244-1631</strong></a></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IECC2021V1.0"><span><u>2021&nbsp;International Energy Conservation Code</u></span></a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IBC2024V1.0"><span><u>2024&nbsp;International Building Code</u></span></a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IEBC2024V1.0"><span><u>2024 International Existing Building Code</u></span></a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IMC2024V2.0"><span><u>2024&nbsp;International Mechanical Code</u></span></a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IRC2024P2"><span><u>2024&nbsp;International Residential Code</u></span></a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="h3"><span>State Adopted Codes</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1djvz5to3UVDPC_g7Z0nwIgBtQwBinmuz"><u>Colorado Model and Solar Ready Code</u>&nbsp;</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.coloradosos.gov/CCR/DisplayRule.do?action=ruleinfo&amp;ruleId=2255&amp;deptID=18&amp;agencyID=33&amp;deptName=Department%20of%20Regulatory%20Agencies&amp;agencyName=Division%20of%20Professions%20and%20Occupations%20-%20State%20Plumbing%20Board&amp;seriesNum=3%20CCR%20720-1"><u>Colorado Plumbing and Fuel Gas Code</u></a></li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IFGC2021P2"><span><u>2021 International Fuel Gas Code</u></span></a>&nbsp;</li>
<li><a href="https://codes.iccsafe.org/content/IPC2021P3"><span><u>2021 International Plumbing Code</u></span></a>&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>
<li>2023 National Electric Code (no link available)&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</div>
      
          </div>
  </div>
</div>
              <div class="accordion paragraph-content">

      
  <h2  class="title h2">
          

            <div class="field-heading">Local requirements</div>
      
      </h2>
    <div class="accordion-group">
            
  <div class="accordion-item">
    <button  aria-controls=1543 id=accordion-1543 class="accordion-title">
