			non-reducible</th>
<th>Wind stagnation&nbsp;<br><br>
			pressure at&nbsp;30 ft. ht.&nbsp;</th>
<th>Basic wind speed&nbsp;<br><br>
			(residential only)</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th>Grand Junction<br><br>
			and surrounding area</th>
<td>30#</td>
<td>13</td>
<td>104</td>
</tr>
<tr>
